# Graph Coloring and Exam Timetable Scheduling

## Objective
To understand graph coloring and its application in exam timetable scheduling.

## Graph Coloring
Graph coloring is the process of assigning colors to vertices of a graph so that no two adjacent vertices have the same color.

## Application
Graph coloring can be used to prepare exam timetables by assigning exams with common students to different time slots.

## Project Goal
To develop a simple exam timetable scheduling system using the graph coloring technique.
